        "line": 1072,
        "text": "theorem physical_fields_natural (T κ w₁ w₂ : ℝ) {p : Point}\n    (hp : p.1 ≤ (Input.ofNatural hΛ F).endpoint) :\n    (ofNatural F hΛ hsmall hδ hδT hP0).physicalF T κ w₁ w₂ p = F.f p ∧\n      (ofNatural F hΛ hsmall hδ hδT hP0).physicalU T κ w₁ p = F.U p"
      }
